# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 207: the pair's formal side, a THIN Consumer: `test(o)` admits an
# Other to the formal `Model: b` when test uses no field of b -- the same admission `Model: b o` takes.  Entry 7.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

fn: test (Model: b) int
    return: 7
end: test

fn: m () int
    o: merge Other
    return: test(o)
end: m

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
